 General Conference.","CHAPTER VI.","THE AFRICAN METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH.","CHAPTER VII.","THE STORY OF MY EARLY LIFE.","My First Marriage and Early Experiences.","CHAPTER VIII.","MY EARLY LIFE IN THE MINISTRY.","CHAPTER IX.","THE EARLY DAYS OF FREEDOM.","CHAPTER X.","OUR FIRST GENERAL CONFERENCE.","CHAPTER XI.","THE SECOND GENERAL CONFERENCE OF THE COLORED METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH IN AMERICA.","CHAPTER XII.","MY EARLY EXPERIENCES AS A BISHOP.","My First Annual Conference.","My Second Annual Conference.","My Third Annual Conference.","CHAPTER XIII.","THE THIRD GENERAL CONFERENCE OF THE COLORED METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH IN AMERICA","CHAPTER XIV.","THE PERIOD FROM 1874 TO 1880, INCLUDING THE FOURTH GENERAL CONFERENCE.","CHAPTER XV.","MY WORK FOLLOWING THE FIFTH AND SIXTH GENERAL CONFERENCES.","CHAPTER XVI.","THE SEVENTH GENERAL CONFERENCE OF THE COLORED METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH AND SOME TRANSPIRING EVENTS.","CHAPTER XVII.","THE GREAT NEED OF A DENOMINATIONAL SCHOOL - MY INSPIRATION AND EARLY EFFORTS - FOUNDING OF LANE COLLEGE.","Rapid Developments.","CHAPTER XVIII.","A YEAR OF GREAT TRIAL AND SEVERE AFFLICTION.","The New Lane College.","CHAPTER XIX.","MY LABOR AS A CHURCH EXPANSIONIST - WORKING IN THE MISSION FIELD.","CHAPTER XX.","CHURCH ACTIVITIES IN RECENT YEARS.","CHAPTER XXI.","THE THIRTEENTH GENERAL CONFERENCE OF THE COLORED METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH IN AMERICA.","CHAPTER XXII.","DEATH OF MRS. FRANCES A. LANE.[From the Christian Index.]","Your Wife Is In Heaven; We'll Meet Her Again.","(A Poem Dedicated to Bishop Isaac Lane.)","CHAPTER XXIII.","BIOGRAPHICAL. SKETCHES OF THE BISHOPS OF THE COLORED METHODIST EPISCOPAL CHURCH IN AMERICA.","Rt. Rev. Bishop William Henry Miles.","Bishop Richard H. Vanderhorst.","Bishop Joseph A. Beebe.","Bishop Lucius H. Holsey, D.D.","Bishop Isaac Lane, D.D.","Bishop Robert S. Williams, D.D.","Bishop Elias Cottrell, D.D.","Bishop Charles Henry Phillips, D.D.","Bishop M.F. Jamison, D.D.","Bishop R. A. Carter, D.D.","Bishop N